{"id":37874,"bangumiId":37874,"type":2,"name":"CLANNAD 〜AFTER STORY〜もうひとつの世界 杏編","name_cn":"CLANNAD ～AFTER STORY～另一个世界 杏篇","date":"2009-05-24","year":"2009","region":"jp","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg"},"summary":"在光坂高中空无一人的教室内，藤林椋终于鼓起勇气向被人当作不良少年的冈崎朋也表白。幸运的是，她的爱意没有落于虚空，得到了冈崎热情而肯定的回应。两人自此开始交往，望着沉浸在幸福中的妹妹，藤林杏心中自是无法道出的复杂感受。某个明媚的假日，冈崎和杏在公园不期而遇。杏半开玩笑地教冈崎把自己当作椋练习接吻，谁知这一幕却被同学看见，第二天便在学校内传得风言风语。为了消除谣言，杏甚至假装和春原阳平交往。甜蜜又青涩的学生时代，说不清道不明的爱恋情怀……","rating":{"rank":747,"total":8763,"count":{"1":23,"2":8,"3":19,"4":48,"5":199,"6":814,"7":2881,"8":3418,"9":812,"10":541},"score":7.6},"collection":{"on_hold":211,"dropped":70,"wish":1598,"collect":16332,"doing":214},"tags":[{"name":"京阿尼","count":2111,"total_count":217207},{"name":"OVA","count":1818,"total_count":372058},{"name":"Clannad","count":1779,"total_count":21130},{"name":"key","count":1484,"total_count":47518},{"name":"GAL改","count":1011,"total_count":79830},{"name":"校园","count":785,"total_count":471145},{"name":"2009","count":784,"total_count":40025},{"name":"杏篇","count":748,"total_count":748},{"name":"麻枝准","count":732,"total_count":23569},{"name":"催泪","count":690,"total_count":61457},{"name":"治愈","count":522,"total_count":308775},{"name":"游戏改","count":475,"total_count":166357},{"name":"恋爱","count":454,"total_count":583640},{"name":"短发杏","count":281,"total_count":281},{"name":"石原立也","count":238,"total_count":16427},{"name":"京都动画","count":154,"total_count":33621},{"name":"日本","count":113,"total_count":314413},{"name":"京都","count":89,"total_count":7719},{"name":"2009年5月","count":47,"total_count":133},{"name":"STORY～もうひとつの世界","count":46,"total_count":46},{"name":"京都アニメーション","count":45,"total_count"